# POP3 vs IMAP

```text
POP3
 ↓
Retrieve/download email
 ↓
Local client
```

```text
IMAP
 ↓
Email remains on server
 ↓
Multiple clients synchronize
```

| Feature | POP3 | IMAP |
|---|---|---|
| Main purpose | Download/retrieve mail | Access and synchronize mail |
| Default port | 110 | 143 |
| TLS port | 995 | 993 |
| Server-side mailbox management | Limited | Strong |
| Multiple devices | Less convenient | Excellent |
| Folder synchronization | Limited | Yes |
| Read/unread synchronization | Limited | Yes |

